@startuml
title Activity 20 - Notification Fetch, Read and Cleanup

|User|
start
:Open Notifications;
|Frontend|
:GET notifications for current user;
|Backend|
:Query notification records;
|Frontend|
:Render unread and read items;
if (Open notification?) then (yes)
  :Click notification;
  :PATCH notification as read;
  :Navigate to related module or record;
endif
if (Mark all read?) then (yes)
  :Click Mark all as read;
  :PATCH all current-user notifications;
endif
if (Delete notification?) then (yes)
  :Confirm deletion;
  :DELETE selected notification;
endif
if (Cleanup old notifications?) then (yes)
  |Backend|
  :Delete expired or user-owned records;
endif
|Frontend|
:Refresh unread count;
stop
@enduml
